{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_003_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:45231d9230c8cf21f6057955cbe58a02b139bc5e488d02e7ed61953c026349cc",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cbd6225b2755d0faaddff0b20ec9a5fbfdc3ad1fce018d048ce67d454e0361d",
      "text": "能听到●●●●プロデューサー这么说，\n我很荣幸呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f8fe762807183d3b4bc0a1723dd3db6f898916a30774dad009535c77b183f30",
      "text": "呵呵。和你聊着聊着，\n明明不在舞台上却感觉要热血沸腾起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ece17199ca8b7b0f06eada979b019d82d4ccbfb268dedfefbd650b1e5354a9cb",
      "text": "我也是，好像有点太激动了。\n真不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:469a45a0aa1d94eadc6a1e64f7b466f89ba117297bb631b549703351fbf3f6da",
      "text": "啊，这份礼物是给北斗先生的呢。\n还附带了留言卡片哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e13143d1d6c2f217f0bdcea956ecfbf690428db0eadce6942bd3efb1b3e7dd7",
      "text": "“北斗先生是我的向往与目标。\n我会紧跟那令人信赖的背影！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28fe3f2d6cc64d0b91c2e02b9e13caa44b382cd0938451e347ad1470315d608b",
      "text": "“今后也期待您的活跃表现！”\n……这样写着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96cd593c2e287365d844ab5fc26ae5f0859cbd5cd8a1d4bcfc76a9699380b5ff",
      "text": "（……曾经迷失了目标的我，背影如今\n在某些人眼里居然也显得令人信赖了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000061:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f0b2832b96e6bfd5b648de79104bb4a00ef4a255cd7c9e7aeb643e5f2f1fd90",
      "text": "好，接下来只要把这个纸箱搬走……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e3dc9fb646655a415d8b47219216ccddbed9c7d6f537ada274b4322482ea40d",
      "text": "嗯！？好沉啊，里面装了什么呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_003hok_01_1_2_003_01:1_2_003_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67d468a11f7f362e338c22f37261404d11213050f9feb9624733104638b9d897",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n让我来试试吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
